---
source: core/src/orchestrator.rs
expression: tool_to_json(&tool)
---
description: "View the audit log of autonomous heartbeat actions. Shows what the LLM did during each autonomous cycle including tools called, actions taken, and tokens used."
name: view_heartbeat_audit
parameters:
  properties:
    limit:
      description: "Maximum entries to return (default: 20, max: 100)"
      type: integer
    skill_name:
      description: Filter by skill name. Omit for all skills.
      type: string
  type: object
